Scope of this licence

This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

Approved Animal Drug Products (the "Green Book") data retrieved from Animal
Drugs @ FDA is a work of the United States Government and is not subject to
copyright. Structured Product Label content retrieved from DailyMed is
published by the U.S. National Library of Medicine.

This repository contains no content from Plumb's Veterinary Drug Handbook or
any other commercial formulary.

---

Clinical disclaimer

This software reformats data published by the U.S. Food and Drug
Administration. It is not medical advice.

It is not a substitute for the approved product label, nor for Animal Drugs @
FDA (https://animaldrugsatfda.fda.gov), which remains the authoritative source.
This tool holds a periodic extract and may lag the current FDA record.

It presents FDA-labelled use only and provides no extra-label dosing. Any use
outside the labelled species, dose, route or indication is extra-label and
remains the prescriber's professional responsibility under AMDUCA. Verify all
information against the current approved label and against Animal Drugs @ FDA
before making a prescribing decision.
